WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — prov-dramabox-42000021392 — Episode 46 — English subtitles
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-27 from the real episode audio (faster-whisper small).

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
I lift boulders with one hand.

2
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:04.800
You think a piece of scrap metal is gonna beat me?

3
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:07.200
My grip slip, that's all.

4
00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:10.800
Of course! I know what you're capable of. Just try again.

5
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:21.800
He's already pulling lightning from Glaio.

6
00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:25.610
And the lance still won't drudge an inch.

7
00:00:25.610 --> 00:00:27.610
Drop the act, Lucian.

8
00:00:28.110 --> 00:00:30.610
What new lie are you cooking up to pin on me this time?

9
00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:37.680
Your Grace, something's wrong with this lance.

10
00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:40.180
No one could possibly lift it.

11
00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:44.180
The heir to the Royal Dragon Knight Academy can't even lift a rookie's weapon.

12
00:00:44.680 --> 00:00:49.680
Seriously, Lucian, maybe you should repeat a year, get a few more reps in at the Academy.

13
00:00:49.680 --> 00:00:51.180
Shut your mouths!

14
00:00:52.180 --> 00:00:54.180
You set me up!

15
00:00:54.180 --> 00:00:57.680
You tell me, what dark magic did you put on this lance?

16
00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:04.090
Lucian's faking it. The lance is light, see?

17
00:01:04.590 --> 00:01:06.590
One hand, no problem.

18
00:01:07.090 --> 00:01:10.220
Quit framing me.

19
00:01:10.720 --> 00:01:12.720
Or are you actually weaker than I am?

20
00:01:12.720 --> 00:01:15.720
Here. Take it.
